---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title='What Is a Smart "Talking" Website?'
  description='Learn what a Smart "Talking" Website actually is, how it helps local businesses capture and qualify more leads, and where to find pricing options from Shelby Web Company.'
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <header class="mb-16 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-cyan/20 bg-brand-cyan/5">
          <span class="text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Shelby Web Official</span>
          <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/30"></span>
          <span class="text-brand-sky/60 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-8 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          What Is a Smart "Talking" Website? <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue">And Why It Does Way More Than Just "Talk"</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-brand-sky/80 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Don't let the name throw you. A Smart "Talking" Website is not just a chatbot widget. It is a full lead-generation system built to convert visitors into real conversations and booked opportunities.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-sky/90 mb-12">
          If you have ever wondered what this offer actually includes, this guide breaks it down in plain English.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">First: What It Is</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          A Smart "Talking" Website combines professional web design, conversion-focused page structure, and an AI-powered conversational assistant trained on your business. Instead of passively waiting for someone to call, your site actively engages visitors, answers questions, and helps route them to the next step.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">In simple terms:</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-0">
            It is your website, sales assistant, FAQ system, and lead capture flow all working together in one place.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">What It Actually Does (Beyond "Talking")</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 list-none p-0 mb-12">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan font-bold text-sm">1</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Qualifies leads in real time:</strong> Asks useful questions so you get better inquiries, not random tire-kickers.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan font-bold text-sm">2</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Answers common objections:</strong> Pricing ranges, timelines, service fit, and process questions can be handled instantly.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan font-bold text-sm">3</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Captures contact data cleanly:</strong> Sends qualified lead details so follow-up is faster and easier.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan font-bold text-sm">4</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Improves conversion rate:</strong> Reduces drop-off by giving visitors immediate, relevant responses when intent is highest.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan font-bold text-sm">5</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Supports your SEO strategy:</strong> Better engagement and cleaner site architecture help your long-term visibility goals.</div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Who This Is For</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          This model works especially well for service businesses that get repeat questions and need to respond quickly: contractors, healthcare providers, legal teams, home services, and local business owners who want more qualified inbound opportunities.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">How Pricing Correlates</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          The Smart "Talking" approach can be implemented differently depending on your current setup:
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-brand-sky/80 mb-12">
          <li>• New website build path: ideal if you need a modern site and AI-powered lead flow together.</li>
          <li>• Existing website enhancement path: ideal if your current site is solid and you want to add the smart conversion layer.</li>
          <li>• Full growth path: ideal for businesses combining redesign, SEO, and conversational automation in one strategy.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          For current options and package ranges, review our pricing page:
          <a href="/pricing" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline decoration-brand-cyan/30 underline-offset-4 ml-1">View Pricing</a>
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-dark p-12 rounded-[2rem] text-center relative overflow-hidden my-16">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,rgba(132,204,22,0.1),transparent_70%)]"></div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6 relative z-10">Ready to See If It Fits Your Business?</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-white/80 mb-10 relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            We will walk you through the right setup based on your current website, goals, and lead flow.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center relative z-10">
            <a href="/pricing" class="bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all">
              Compare Pricing Options
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-white border border-white/20 px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-white/20 transition-all">
              Book a Strategy Call
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/70">
          Bottom line: a Smart "Talking" Website is less about novelty and more about results. It helps your website behave like a real growth tool, not just an online brochure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 mb-4 p-6 bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl text-brand-sky/70 text-sm">
        <strong class="text-white">Keep reading:</strong> the <a href="/blog/ai-development-stack-2026" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">AI development stack</a> that powers these sites, what it <a href="/blog/website-cost-shelby-nc-2026" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">costs to build one</a>, and whether your business still <a href="/blog/does-your-business-need-a-website-2026" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">needs a website in 2026</a>.
      </div>
      <footer class="mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-8 items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/blog" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Blog
        </a>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <a href="/pricing" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Pricing</a>
          <a href="/services/web-design" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Web Design</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
